@startuml SD-销售订单用例图

title SD模块 - 销售订单子模块用例图

left to right direction

actor 销售员 as sales
actor 销售经理 as salesManager
actor 工程师 as engineer
actor 物料管理员 as warehouse
actor 财务人员 as finance

rectangle "销售订单管理" {
  usecase "创建销售订单\n(UC-SD-010)" as UC010
  usecase "提交销售订单评审\n(UC-SD-011)" as UC011
  usecase "销售部门评审订单\n(UC-SD-012)" as UC012
  usecase "工程部门评审订单\n(UC-SD-013)" as UC013
  usecase "物料部门评审订单\n(UC-SD-014)" as UC014
  usecase "财务部门评审订单\n(UC-SD-015)" as UC015
  usecase "拒绝销售订单\n(UC-SD-016)" as UC016
  usecase "销售发货\n(UC-SD-017)" as UC017
  usecase "销售签收\n(UC-SD-018)" as UC018
  usecase "对账\n(UC-SD-019)" as UC019
  usecase "关闭销售订单\n(UC-SD-020)" as UC020
}

sales --> UC010 : 创建订单
sales --> UC011 : 提交评审
sales --> UC017 : 发货
sales --> UC018 : 签收
sales --> UC020 : 关闭订单

salesManager --> UC012 : 销售部门评审
sales --> UC012 : 销售部门评审
engineer --> UC013 : 工程部门评审
warehouse --> UC014 : 物料部门评审
finance --> UC015 : 财务部门评审
finance --> UC019 : 对账
finance --> UC020 : 关闭订单

salesManager --> UC016 : 拒绝
sales --> UC016 : 拒绝
engineer --> UC016 : 拒绝
warehouse --> UC016 : 拒绝
finance --> UC016 : 拒绝

UC010 ..> UC011 : <<extend>>
UC011 ..> UC012 : <<extend>>
UC012 ..> UC013 : <<extend>>
UC013 ..> UC014 : <<extend>>
UC014 ..> UC015 : <<extend>>
UC012 ..> UC016 : <<extend>>
UC013 ..> UC016 : <<extend>>
UC014 ..> UC016 : <<extend>>
UC015 ..> UC016 : <<extend>>
UC015 ..> UC017 : <<extend>>
UC017 ..> UC018 : <<extend>>
UC018 ..> UC019 : <<extend>>
UC019 ..> UC020 : <<extend>>

note right of UC010
  创建销售订单
  可选择关联报价单或直接创建
  返单可选择历史报价单并修改数量
  新单只能选择已批准且未关联的报价单
  系统自动查找FactoryProductMapping
end note

note right of UC011
  多部门评审流程（串行）
  销售 → 工程 → 物料 → 财务
end note

note right of UC020
  关闭销售订单时
  会同时关闭关联的生产订单/工单
end note

@enduml
